# ProjectGate Project Instructions

This repository uses ProjectGate.

## Always-on rules

1. Start ambiguous or high-risk tasks with read-only audit.
2. Do not guess.
3. Missing facts stop progress or trigger read-only fact collection.
4. Destructive actions require explicit owner authorization.
5. Follow the active Project Pack and active SOPs.
6. Use owner decision protocol when judgment or authorization is needed.
7. Record repeatable failures as incident candidates.
8. Record reusable workflows as SOP candidates.

## Skill routing

Use the configured ProjectGate workflow for tasks that involve project files, code, configuration, release, operations, data, or long-running analysis.
